## 8. Data Retention

Bazaar Rush does not operate a user-account system or maintain a personal user database as part of its core gameplay, unless this changes in a future version.

Game progress and settings may be stored locally on your device.

Advertising providers may retain information collected through their services according to their own retention policies, legal obligations, and business practices.

We do not control the retention periods of data independently processed by third-party advertising providers.

## 9. International Data Transfers

Third-party service providers, including Google, may process information in countries outside your country of residence, including countries outside the European Economic Area.

Where GDPR applies, transfers of personal data outside the EEA are subject to applicable legal safeguards where required, such as adequacy decisions or appropriate contractual safeguards.

Please consult the relevant third-party privacy policies for further information about international data transfers.

## 10. Your Privacy Rights

If GDPR or other applicable data protection laws apply to you, you may have the following rights:

- **Right of access:** Request information about personal data processed about you.
- **Right to rectification:** Request correction of inaccurate personal data.
- **Right to erasure:** Request deletion of personal data where applicable.
- **Right to restriction:** Request restriction of certain processing activities.
- **Right to data portability:** Request your personal data in a portable format where applicable.
- **Right to object:** Object to certain processing activities where applicable.
- **Right to withdraw consent:** Withdraw consent at any time where processing is based on consent.

To exercise these rights regarding processing for which we are responsible, contact us using the details provided in Section 14.

Some information may be processed directly by third-party advertising providers. In those cases, you may also need to exercise your rights directly with the relevant provider.

## 11. Children's Privacy

Bazaar Rush is not specifically designed for children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children through account registration or direct user submissions, as the Game does not currently require such features.

Advertising services may have additional age-related requirements and restrictions.

If you believe that personal information relating to a child has been processed inappropriately, please contact us so we can investigate.

Where required, we will implement appropriate age-related advertising restrictions and privacy protections.

## 12. Security

We and our service providers take reasonable measures to protect information against unauthorised access, loss, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.

However, no method of electronic storage or transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

## 13. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes to Bazaar Rush, advertising services, legal requirements, or privacy practices.

The updated policy will be published at the same URL, with the revised update date.

